        },
        {
          "id": "b",
          "text": "$3\\frac{7}{12}$"
        },
        {
          "id": "c",
          "text": "$4\\frac{1}{12}$"
        },
        {
          "id": "d",
          "text": "$3\\frac{4}{7}$"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "c",
      "explanation": "Convert to improper fractions: $\\frac{7}{3} + \\frac{7}{4}$. Common denominator 12: $\\frac{28}{12} + \\frac{21}{12} = \\frac{49}{12} = 4\\frac{1}{12}$."
    },
